# The local stand uses a default-deny build context. The verifier treats this
# file as the policy source and checks its security invariants and examples.
**

# Workspace manifests and license.
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!LICENSE

# Production Rust manifests and sources. Directories must be re-included
# before Docker can traverse them; each reopened level is immediately denied
# again so only the subsequent file rules survive.
